{"title":"phony","artist":"츠미키","sourceId":"reference:HzC48Nylnfk8mCGXPrl8","sourceHash":"4c256a1f7a7944e812ce09eb0e34ab50c7ba3e8ec1082ad0d125ea2f51add3ee","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":28784873,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.87,"end":5.95,"text":"この世で造花より綺麗な花は無いわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":5.95,"end":10.04,"text":"何故ならば総ては嘘で出来ている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":10.04,"end":27.84,"text":"Antipathy world","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":27.84,"end":32.81,"text":"絶望の雨はあたしの傘を突いて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":32.81,"end":36.68,"text":"湿らす前髪とこころの裏面","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":36.68,"end":38.24,"text":"煩わしいわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":38.24,"end":41.9,"text":"何時しか言の葉は疾うに枯れきって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":41.9,"end":44.63,"text":"事の実があたしに熟れている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":44.63,"end":50.28,"text":"鏡に映り嘘を描いて自らを見失なった絵画","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":50.28,"end":52.31,"text":"パパッパラパッパララッパッパ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":52.31,"end":55.97,"text":"謎々かぞえて遊びましょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":55.97,"end":58.05,"text":"タタッタラタッタララッタッタ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":58.05,"end":61.46,"text":"何故何故此処で踊っているでしょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":61.46,"end":66.53,"text":"簡単なことも解らないわ あたしって何だっけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":66.53,"end":72.75,"text":"それすら夜の手に絆されて 愛のように（消える消える）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":72.75,"end":77.74,"text":"さようならも言えぬ儘 泣いた フォニイフォニイフォニイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":77.74,"end":83.33,"text":"嘘に絡まっているあたしはフォニイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":83.33,"end":94.85,"text":"（Antipathy world）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":94.85,"end":98.21000000000001,"text":"何時しかそらの音がいやに鳴り合って","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":98.21000000000001,"end":101.1,"text":"色の目があなたを溶いている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":101.1,"end":106.52000000000001,"text":"鏡に映るあたしを欠いて誰しもが見間違った虚像","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":106.52000000000001,"end":112.33,"text":"如何して愛なんてものに群がりそれを欲して生きるのだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":112.33,"end":116.83,"text":"今日も泳いでいる夜の電車が通り去っていく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":116.83,"end":118.3,"text":"踊り明かせよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":118.3,"end":119.78999999999999,"text":"パッパラパッパララッパッパ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":119.78999999999999,"end":123.47,"text":"謎々騙して歌いましょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":123.47,"end":125.66,"text":"タタッタラタッタララッタッタ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":125.66,"end":140.4,"text":"何故何故此処が痛むのでしょう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":140.4,"end":146.14,"text":"散々な日々は変わらないわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":146.14,"end":151.75,"text":"絶望の雨は止まないわ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":151.75,"end":156.76,"text":"さようならも言えぬ儘 泣いた フォニイフォニイフォニイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":156.76,"end":160.2,"text":"嘘に絡まっている ただ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":160.2,"end":165.07999999999998,"text":"簡単なことも解らないわ あたしって何だっけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":165.07999999999998,"end":171.61,"text":"それすら夜の手に絆されて 愛のように（消える消える）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":171.61,"end":176.4,"text":"さようならまたねと呟いた フォニイフォニイフォニイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":176.4,"end":182.16,"text":"嘘に絡まっているあたしはフォニイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":182.16,"end":186.14,"text":"造花だけが知っている秘密のフォニイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}